{
  "voice": "voice-01",
  "language": "zh-CN",
  "alignment": "one-clip-one-shot-one-caption",
  "slowdown_allowed": true,
  "min_tempo_factor": 0.8,
  "max_speedup_factor": 1.35,
  "clips": [
    {
      "id": "S01",
      "file": "S01.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "narration_id": "N01",
      "target_start": 0,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "text": "一九四八年冬天，东京在战后的寒夜里飘着雪。",
      "sha256": "503dfaa4825c06dad71ee93e0b187a29dc8ec1f31ef0a7a0d6de991be2da32df"
    },
    {
      "id": "S02",
      "file": "S02.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "narration_id": "N01",
      "target_start": 5,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "text": "帝国银行大堂灯火未熄，职员们仍在整理账目。",
      "sha256": "a94d4729c249c0adb86e41f2e4422413e75c8f31b9fa09fec411e5403bcd94ca"
    },
    {
      "id": "S03",
      "file": "S03.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 10,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "text": "门外，一个自称防疫官的男人递来名片，还自称叫山口二郎。",
      "sha256": "a650f3dff8e360f32047f492f4bc1780c65f2b8192a2f6ab7a4fe09224495631"
    },
    {
      "id": "S04",
      "file": "S04.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 17,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "text": "他声称附近发生痢疾疫情，奉命送来预防药，请众人立刻服下。",
      "sha256": "f8a214552e7a2148765d9bc15ab169721b79b79c96427147a490900a1632c3af"
    },
    {
      "id": "S05",
      "file": "S05.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 24,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "text": "窗外，美军吉普车驶过废墟街道，忙碌的身影映进玻璃。",
      "sha256": "494abdde407844da7e19cacab639b1741c4e28fa124c76cb8efbf94d8c8e6236"
    },
    {
      "id": "S06",
      "file": "S06.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 30,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "text": "他打开药箱，取出两瓶透明液体，解释要分两次服用。",
      "sha256": "106c65f221669c07e6d347dafa61d39e89a4d642c09bae614e5ad2e01f591d5e"
    },
    {
      "id": "S07",
      "file": "S07.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 35,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "text": "十六名银行职员依次站成一排，每个人面前的桌上，都放着一只小杯。",
      "sha256": "008200a9cb695fc86021ed41784bcbbbc59b9f06b9f71d44604c4363581ad7d1"
    },
    {
      "id": "S08",
      "file": "S08.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 42,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "text": "来人先举杯示范，职员们相互观望，最后还是照他说的喝下。",
      "sha256": "2d6e7bc12bce5187090324bbabff6149c5ee06a0cd173dd2d27ddf56e7d0166e"
    },
    {
      "id": "S09",
      "file": "S09.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 49,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "text": "整座银行陷入沉静，职员们无声地等着秒针走过一分钟。",
      "sha256": "18142c01856c10cbf117e70c69a00b2a92a2d43c1697db86b2076a65a2d4683d"
    },
    {
      "id": "S10",
      "file": "S10.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 55,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "text": "随后，第二种药水倒入杯中，职员再次服下。",
      "sha256": "846e91b2bf668b05a90ac117354d23c79de8b1edf4a0550efd7843c9a26c326e"
    },
    {
      "id": "S11",
      "file": "S11.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 60,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "text": "几分钟后，大堂传来杯子碎裂声，散落的算盘珠滚进柜台底下。",
      "sha256": "63246a98c064382b4040c11805ab04b1ed76a6ec23889cb3028ee37fde7149cb"
    },
    {
      "id": "S12",
      "file": "S12.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 67,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "text": "来人趁着混乱取走现金和支票，拎起药箱，从后门匆匆离开。",
      "sha256": "eb28ebd3ed5d3192b7c7efd81b3df8e60e84e0c89748ca9ee32ab1ef44d908f6"
    },
    {
      "id": "S13",
      "file": "S13.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 74,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "text": "警车与救护车相继赶到，医护人员进入银行，街边围起人群。",
      "sha256": "9b2c3ee8a95072d3e38d3a15cab01739d7fb8347a06c7e20501d1ca244a3779e"
    },
    {
      "id": "S14",
      "file": "S14.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 80,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "text": "报社印刷机彻夜轰鸣，帝银案很快登上全国报纸头版。",
      "sha256": "0aae8f49e95f8601c80a09a3b8e881fa69bccb2cf18720f5c2db6bc21716a5d0"
    },
    {
      "id": "S15",
      "file": "S15.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 85,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "text": "调查人员后来发现，案发前，另外两家银行也遇到过相似的防疫说辞。",
      "sha256": "46e8d31532b6acdab0a4e420ed71daba69f7f75ce399f8c288fe48e77bb86f04"
    },
    {
      "id": "S16",
      "file": "S16.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 92,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "text": "安田银行的职员当时拒绝服药，那个男人只好转身离开现场。",
      "sha256": "543121262eb6a904fa4803c265368a2e37e95e48731d29cc5172a2886fa98993"
    },
    {
      "id": "S17",
      "file": "S17.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 99,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "text": "侦查人员循线追查，一张名片，成为确认身份的重要线索。",
      "sha256": "a3d7c277d8aad8f1f5a2ad1d5e62ce62af2cf5954c02422203490ba7a11c065e"
    },
    {
      "id": "S18",
      "file": "S18.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 105,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "text": "名片属于松井蔚医生；他却称，自己并不认识这个来人。",
      "sha256": "f9ccc539562bfc78508c09b6be782529d265771b972cf2d961554916b5cf0eb4"
    },
    {
      "id": "S19",
      "file": "S19.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 110,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "text": "警方沿着名片上的身份继续调查，线索逐渐指向远在北海道。",
      "sha256": "eff5af58aab8e5665c5a4bf721bfb4d26818fec3e777e4e27ddfe9d20f205f35"
    },
    {
      "id": "S20",
      "file": "S20.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 117,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "text": "在北海道的小樽，警方最终找到一位画家，他名叫平泽贞通。",
      "sha256": "d56cf33aa9604e20db4e07690dbfa2d83ab1b05ee37439f9a2fce1fdaf906131"
    },
    {
      "id": "S21",
      "file": "S21.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 124,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "text": "当时五十七岁的平泽正在画室作画，生活与银行相距遥远。",
      "sha256": "8ef50fa67b4f7b281a09fc87ba6069fe5c29f293f0858a09e078bba88eeae38d"
    },
    {
      "id": "S22",
      "file": "S22.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 130,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "text": "一九四八年八月二十一日，平泽在北海道被警方逮捕。",
      "sha256": "0019e0bf5ffb446c7eb6d7a8a8b27e156eca3c0904ed1abb97cede5c0d8459e1"
    },
    {
      "id": "S23",
      "file": "S23.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "narration_id": "N07",
      "target_start": 135,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "text": "审讯记录留下他的认罪供述；后来，他对这份供述提出异议。",
      "sha256": "ea8c4ebec1ec37aa187c91fc2639c2a2b1ac560158fef2c2508d4ed7d2b9bc5a"
    },
    {
      "id": "S24",
      "file": "S24.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "narration_id": "N07",
      "target_start": 142,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "text": "到了法庭，平泽翻供，称先前的供述是在压力之下被迫作出的。",
      "sha256": "b3c9a22fc30e5564b1275cbe8a35d8649a8141eb216b3d52c2a18d6b76f3027e"
    },
    {
      "id": "S25",
      "file": "S25.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "narration_id": "N07",
      "target_start": 149,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "text": "法槌落下，判决没有平息争议，关于证据的质疑仍在。",
      "sha256": "877dabc56bd0b878dd8bc407a92e939c26fdf1b7d560c7fededb523e76dd24f4"
    },
    {
      "id": "S26",
      "file": "S26.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "narration_id": "N08",
      "target_start": 155,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "text": "一九五〇年，东京地方法院一审判处画家平泽贞通死刑。",
      "sha256": "5d0c4aba0f90a9b37a02e54024ba10e5c2fd23c95c39b71fa7365d6c8b94ef1b"
    },
    {
      "id": "S27",
      "file": "S27.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "narration_id": "N08",
      "target_start": 161,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "text": "不同目击者对嫌疑人的辨认结果并不一致，案件因此留下诸多疑点。",
      "sha256": "d94c18a34ec80208dcc287309d63a3be094450cc305984c13a778363940c326a"
    },
    {
      "id": "S28",
      "file": "S28.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "narration_id": "N08",
      "target_start": 167,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "text": "关于731部队涉案，至今仍只是未经证实的传闻。",
      "sha256": "880cbcd670c59e9f60ff8eeee71dcf7a1c798135ecab85feb535302b5bed967b"
    },
    {
      "id": "S29",
      "file": "S29.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "narration_id": "N09",
      "target_start": 172,
      "target_duration": 8,
      "text": "死刑未执行，平泽喊冤近四十年，直到一九八七年病逝狱中——真凶是谁？",
      "sha256": "0f07a51cbb57214c0b2beecd3b7f67ca8390535fe2208d36a6b5793eefb5f8e2"
    }
  ]
}
